@startuml security_layers
title Security Layers - Defense in Depth (Docker Required)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999

' ==================== LAYER 0: RATE LIMITING ====================
rectangle "Layer 0: Rate Limiting" as L0 #PaleGreen {
    component "Token Bucket" as rate_bucket
    component "Per-IP Tracking" as ip_track
}

note right of L0
  **Blocks:** DoS attacks
  60 req/min, burst: 10
  Returns 429 + Retry-After
end note

' ==================== LAYER 1: API VALIDATION ====================
rectangle "Layer 1: API Validation" as L1 #LightBlue {
    component "Pydantic Validation" as pydantic
    component "Code Length (100KB)" as len_check
}

note right of L1
  **Blocks:**
  Oversized payloads
  Invalid JSON format
  Missing fields
end note

' ==================== LAYER 2: CODE VALIDATION ====================
rectangle "Layer 2: Code Validation" as L2 #LightGreen {
    component "Empty Check" as empty
    component "UTF-8 Encoding" as encoding
    component "Syntax Check" as syntax
    component "Pattern Scanner" as pattern
}

note right of L2
  **Blocks:**
  Empty code
  Invalid encoding
  Syntax errors
  __class__, __bases__...
end note

' ==================== LAYER 3: DOCKER CONTAINER ====================
rectangle "Layer 3: Docker Container (MANDATORY)" as L3 #LightCoral {
    component "--network=none" as net_none
    component "--read-only" as read_only
    component "--cap-drop=ALL" as cap_drop
    component "--memory=128m" as mem_limit
    component "--pids-limit=50" as pids_limit
    component "--user=nobody" as user_ns
    component "Docker default seccomp" as seccomp
}

note right of L3
  **Blocks (OS Level):**
  Network access (complete)
  Filesystem write
  All capabilities
  Memory exhaustion
  Fork bombs
  Privilege escalation
  Seccomp: 44+ syscalls blocked
end note

' ==================== LAYER 4: PYTHON SANDBOX ====================
rectangle "Layer 4: Python Sandbox" as L4 #Lavender {
    component "Module Whitelist" as whitelist
    component "Restricted Builtins" as builtins
    component "Attribute Blocking" as attr_block
    component "Resource Limits" as res_limits
}

note right of L4
  **Blocks (Python Level):**
  Unauthorized imports
  eval, exec, open...
  __class__ escape
  CPU/memory (backup)
end note

' ==================== LAYER 5: CONCURRENCY ====================
rectangle "Layer 5: Concurrency Control" as L5 #Pink {
    component "Semaphore (max 10)" as semaphore
}

note right of L5
  **Blocks:**
  Server overload
  Resource exhaustion
end note

' ==================== FLOW ====================
L0 -down-> L1 : Rate OK
L1 -down-> L2 : Valid request
L2 -down-> L3 : Valid code
L3 -down-> L4 : Isolated container
L4 -down-> L5 : Sandbox active

' ==================== ATTACK EXAMPLES ====================
note as attacks
  **Attacks Blocked:**

  1. **Fork Bomb** import os; while True: os.fork()
     Layer 3: --pids-limit
     Layer 4: whitelist (os not allowed)

  2. **Network Access** import socket
     Layer 3: --network=none (complete)
     Layer 4: whitelist (socket not allowed)

  3. **Sandbox Escape** ().__class__.__bases__
     Layer 2: pattern scanner
     Layer 4: attribute blocking

  4. **File Access** open("/etc/passwd")
     Layer 3: --read-only filesystem
     Layer 4: open removed from builtins

  5. **Memory Bomb** x = "A" * 10**10
     Layer 3: --memory=128m (Docker)
     Layer 4: resource.setrlimit (backup)

  6. **DoS Attack** 1000 requests/second
     Layer 0: rate limiting (429)
     Layer 5: semaphore (max 10)
end note

@enduml
